creatures:
- name: Incubus
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 66 (rollable(dice=12d8 + 12,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Fly 60 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Deception rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Deception Check), Insight rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Insight Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Perception Check), Persuasion rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Persuasion Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** cold, fire, poison, psychic  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 15  
      **Languages** Abyssal, Common, Infernal; telepathy 60 ft.  
      **Challenge** 4 (1,100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Succubus Form.*** When the incubus finishes a ***Long Rest***, it can shape-shift into a *Succubus*, using that stat block instead of this one. Any equipment it's wearing or carrying isn't transformed.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The incubus makes two Restless Touch attacks.

      ***Restless Touch.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+7,label=+7,dicelabel=To Hit [Restless Touch]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d6+5,dicelabel=Damage [Restless Touch]) Psychic damage, and the target is cursed for 24 hours or until the incubus dies. Until the curse ends, the target gains no benefit from finishing Short Rests.

      ***Spellcasting.*** The incubus casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 15):

      At will: [Disguise Self](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619102-disguise-self), [Etherealness](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619193-etherealness)  
      1/day each: [Dream](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619156-dream), [Hypnotic Pattern](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619168-hypnotic-pattern)  

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Nightmare (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Nightmare])).*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 15, one creature the incubus can see within 60 feet. *Failure:* If the target has 20 ***Hit Points*** or fewer, it has the ***Unconscious*** condition for 1 hour, until it takes damage, or until a creature within 5 feet of it takes an action to wake it. Otherwise, the target takes rollable(dice=4d8,dicelabel=Damage [Nightmare]) Psychic damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Medium Fiend, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 4
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024incubus
  status: 1

